title: Typing on one line of a file with mixed line ends changes only that line, and typing at the very start of a file with a BOM goes after the BOM
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/mixed_eol.txt :: (?-i)\Aone\r\ntwo\nthree\r\nXfour\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/bom.txt :: (?-i)\AXfirst\nsecond\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/trailing_ws.txt :: (?-i)\Aa  \nb\t\nX\n\n\z

wait 3000
edit mixed_eol.txt 4 1
type X
key save
wait 300
edit bom.txt 1 1
type X
wait 300
mark bom
wait 400
key save
wait 300
edit trailing_ws.txt 3 1
type X
key save
wait 400
quit
